# Participant-level data and anything derived from it are never committed.
# Survey files, census tables and third-party survey documents (see README.md, "Input files"):
/data_raw
# Harmonised participant-level file written by Stage 1:
data_derived/analytic.*
# Intermediate R objects written by Stage 2 (they hold participant-level records):
output/rds/
# Run logs (they print record-level checks):
output/logs/
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/
.DS_Store
# Participant-level files that the preprocessing scripts read or write, wherever they are put:
*.dta
steps86long.xlsx
steps86subset_F.xlsx
steps86_weight_standard*.csv
Steps90_weighted.csv
# Census tables of the Statistical Centre of Iran, if downloaded for the preprocessing scripts (not redistributed here):
preprocessing/census_2006/files/
preprocessing/census_2011/90/
